# Force LF line endings for the files the local-dev workflow reads/executes
# on checkout, regardless of a Windows clone's core.autocrlf setting. Without
# this, Git for Windows' default autocrlf=true rewrites these to CRLF, which
# is unnecessary risk for anything env-parsed or run inside Linux containers.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
.env.example text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
